    ],
    "text": "THEREWITH AND INCIDENTAL THERETO",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      277.61,
      401.9,
      301.31
    ],
    "text": "BE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      314.81,
      401.86,
      350.99
    ],
    "text": "1.This Act may be cited as the Revocation ofIrrevocable Deeds of Gift on the ground of Gross IngratitudeAct, No. of 2017.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      364.37,
      401.89,
      425.27
    ],
    "text": "2.An irrevocable deed of gift may be revoked onthe ground of gross ingratitude, only on an Order madeby a competent court, in an action filed by the donorof such deed against the donee to have the saiddeed revoked.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      438.77,
      401.9,
      499.67
    ],
    "text": "3.Court shall not entertain an action referred toin section 2, unless it is filed within a period of ten yearsfrom the date of the execution of such deed of gift andwithin two years from the date on which the cause ofaction arose.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      513.17,
      401.89,
      561.71
    ],
    "text": "4.(1) The plaintiff in an action instituted under theprovisions of this Act shall file or cause to be filed in courtwith the plaint, an application for registration of lispendens\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      177.57,
      575.21,
      401.89,
      611.27
    ],
    "text": "(a)addressed to the Registrar of Lands of the district inwhich the deed which is sought to be revoked isregistered; or",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      177.57,
      624.77,
      401.88,
      673.79
    ],
    "text": "(b)where the deed sought to be revoked is notregistered, addressed to the Registrar of Lands ofthe district in which the land referred to in suchdeed is situated.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      407.85,
      366.19,
      448.3,
      432.86
    ],
    "text": "Revocationof anirrevocabledeed of giftby acompetentcourt.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      407.85,
      439.15,
      452.86,
      477.02
    ],
    "text": "Time periodwithin whichaction shallbe filed.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      407.85,
      514.15,
      451.3,
      580.82
    ],
    "text": "Plaintiff toapply forregistrationof the actionas a lispendens incourts.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
