    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      157.15,
      202.97,
      397.21,
      274.31
    ],
    "text": "(2) The application referred to in subsection (1), shall bein triplicate and marked \u201coriginal\u201d, \u201c1st copy\u201d and \u201c2ndcopy\u201d and shall be substantially in the form set out in theRegistration of Documents Ordinance (Chapter 117) andshall contain a blank space for the insertion of the number tobe assigned to the action by the court.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      157.15,
      286.97,
      397.17,
      322.31
    ],
    "text": "5.Every action filed under the provisions of this Actshall be proceeded with and regulated by the procedureprovided for in the Civil Procedure Code (Chapter 101).",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      169.15,
      334.97,
      394.16,
      346.31
    ],
    "text": "6.In this Act, unless the context otherwise requires\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      181.15,
      358.97,
      397.18,
      442.31
    ],
    "text": "\u201cRegistrar of Lands\u201d means the Registrar of Landsappointed under the Registration of DocumentsOrdinance (Chapter 117) and havingjurisdiction over the district in which the landwhich forms the subject matter of an irrevocabledeed of gift which is sought to be revoked issituated; and",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      181.15,
      454.97,
      397.2,
      490.31
    ],
    "text": "\u201cLand\u201d shall have the same meaning as in theRegistration of Documents Ordinance(Chapter 117).",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      157.15,
      502.97,
      397.2,
      526.31
    ],
    "text": "7.In the event of any inconsistency between the Sinhalaand Tamil texts of this Act, the Sinhala text shall prevail.",
    "fonts": [
